  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electric potential&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Electric potential and electric field are related as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p><p>At the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Thus, electric field is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;along negative <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8208;</mo></math> axis.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
